> **Reminder co-routing (only if the reminder service appears in the Service Router above):** Load `reminders/PROTOCOL.md` and use the `reminder` CLI for ANY reminder-related operation — create, edit, delete, or list — regardless of how the request is phrased. If creating a reminder alongside a primary classification, do this after processing the primary route.
